      "id": "p0155-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Licca-chan is a classic dress-up doll series in Japan that debuted in the late 1960s. In simple terms, Licca-chan is the Japanese equivalent of the United States' popular Barbie doll series.",
        "raw": "Licca-chan is a classic dress-up doll series in Japan that debuted in the late\n1960s. In simple terms, Licca-chan is the Japanese equivalent of the United\nStates' popular Barbie doll series.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
